    {
      "id": "claim_4393b0fcfe4f4e0ea7dd76dec15b39dd",
      "statement": "Boundary packages the `rta` client from the same checkout and can set `RTA_SERVER` in the investigation task. Operators invoke this client from the shell; creating a Boundary task does not itself submit a Trusted Actions execution.",
